<title>FINLAND: ARCTOS CAPITAL SETS FIM 31/SHR ISSUE PRICE.</title>
<headline>ARCTOS CAPITAL SETS FIM 31/SHR ISSUE PRICE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish investment company Arctos Capital Oy said in a statement on Wednesday it had halted subscriptions to its share offering due to good demand and proposed a subscription price of 31.00 markka per share.</p>
</text>
